                                                "sense_id": "0818004f-e7b5-31af-bb3b-7608d0ae07cc",
                                                "text": "It was the profoundest hour of the night, their third as inmates of Princess Celestial Hind’s dosshouse, a converted wool factory fronting on an alley off Sturgeon Street, not far from the Caspian wharfs."
